OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChef visits schools to share
OL,4,Adyslexia experiences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA chef who was diagnosed with dyslexia
OL,7,Faged 61 says living with the condition
OL,8,Fallows him to find "original ways of
OL,9,Fsolving problems".
OL,11,FNick Jaye, from Brighton, retrained as
OL,12,Fa chef in his late 50s after working as
OL,13,Fan estate agent and went on to write
OL,14,Fhis own recipe book designed to be read
OL,15,Feasily by people with dyslexia.
OL,17,FJaye, who says he left school at 15
OL,18,Fwith no qualifications, has visited
OL,19,Fspecialist dyslexia school Frewen
OL,20,FCollege in Rye, and Northiam Primary
OL,21,FSchool in East Sussex, to share his
OL,22,Fexperiences.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
