OL,3,GNEWSAChef visits schools to share
OL,4,Adyslexia experiences
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "We should think of dyslexic
OL,7,Fpeople as like everyone else, except we
OL,8,Fgo around a problem in a different
OL,9,Fway."
